HOL Light
=========

Upstream: https://github.com/jrh13/hol-light
Notice: LICENSES/HOL-Light.txt

This package is conservatively distributed subject to the HOL Light notice in
addition to its 0BSD license. The closest correspondences are the type and term
representations in htype.rhm and term.rhm and the primitive inference and
definitional rules in kernel.rhm. This package-wide treatment avoids relying
on a narrow distinction between copied expression and a clean reimplementation
of HOL Light's public kernel design.
